	(text " --- Power Block Mechanism ---\n1. Power Routing: 5V inputs (UART 5V, USB 5V, or 12V-to-5V Buck Converter) are stepped down to 3.3V via LDO.\n2. Power Ratings: Buck Converter = 600mA max / LDO = 300mA max.\n3. Power Budget: System is designed for a 150mA max current consumption.\n   (Actual typical load for MCU and peripherals is approx. 75mA, providing a 2x safety margin)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 39.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
